  "_comment": "Which quick events may start where (docs/EVENTS.md, Framework). Every interval_seconds (random in the range, per player) the game rolls once for a player with no event running: it picks among the entries of their dimension that are off cooldown, by weight, then starts the pick with probability chance. Only 'event' is required (weight 1, cooldown_seconds 0, chance 1). Known event ids: see `/archivist event list`. Only dimensions listed under \"dimensions\" get events (library: greyscale_pulse, at most once per 5 minutes). Example: \"archivist:library\": [ { \"event\": \"greyscale_pulse\", \"weight\": 1, \"cooldown_seconds\": 300, \"chance\": 0.5 } ]",
